            .. "\n4. Type the new word or number in Custom Display Text."
            .. "\n5. Press ✅ Apply."
            .. "\n\nYOU CAN CHANGE MORE THAN ONE THING. After you press Apply, just"
            .. " pick another thing to change and press Apply again. The first change"
